  "solution": {
    "text": "<blockquote><p>Given,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>S</mi></math> be the set of all values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#8712;</mo><mo>[</mo><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>,</mo><mi>&#960;</mi><mo>]</mo></math> for which the system of linear equations<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>-</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>y</mi><mo>+</mo><mo>(</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>)</mo><mi>z</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br />has non-trivial solution,</p><p>So, by condition of non-trivial solution we get,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mtable><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd><mtd><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mn>1</mn></mtd><mtd><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>-</mo><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>7</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mfenced><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><msup><mi>tan</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></mfenced><mfenced><mrow><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>-</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>tan</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mo>,</mo><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mo>-</mo><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>,</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>3</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mrow><mn>4</mn></mfrac></math></p><p>Hence,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>120</mn><mi>&#960;</mi></mfrac><mo>&#8721;</mo><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>120</mn><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>20</mn></math></p></blockquote>",
